28 UTC**: Attacker IP `198.51.100.98` conducts web probing/scanning against Nginx web server endpoints (`` `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:370` ``).\n- **2026-08-19 03:20 UTC**: Incident intake ticket opened by SOC monitoring (`` `/sas/handoff/intake.pdf` ``).\n\n## Working Checklist\n- [x] Initial triage of `/sas` alerts and intake files (`` `/sas/alerts.json` ``, `` `/sas/handoff/intake.pdf` ``)\n- [x] Review Threat Intel Advisory and defanged C2 indicators (`` `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:1` ``)\n- [x] Full forensic inspection of `/disk` file system\n- [x] Analyze SSH authentication logs for brute force and root compromise (`` `/disk/var/log/auth.log.1.gz:89` ``)\n- [x] Analyze web logs for web scanner / exploit attempts (`` `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:370` ``)\n- [x] Identify initial access vector & RCE artifact (`` `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/jobs/.tmp/config.xml:1` ``)\n- [x] Identify cryptominer process and binary (`` `/disk/opt/jenkins/.xmr/xmrig:1` ``)\n- [x] Identify cron persistence job (`` `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/jenkins:4` ``)\n- [x] Identify unalerted silent persistence: Groovy init hook (`` `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/init.groovy.d/z-backdoor.groovy:3` ``)\n- [x] Identify unalerted silent persistence: SSH key backdoor (`` `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/.ssh/authorized_keys:2` ``)\n- [x] Identify defense evasion / log wiping artifact (`` `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` ``)\n- [x] Distinguish legitimate benign operational scripts from malicious backdoors (`` `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/init.groovy.d/logging.groovy:2` ``)\n- [x] Reconcile stale change ticket `CHG-1700` in place (`` `/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md` ``)\n- [x] Update JSON findings schema mapping (`` `/sas/handoff/findings.json` ``)\n- [x] Generate required report deliverables in `/app`\nEOF\n"] min_timeout_sec: 0.5 max_timeout_sec: 180.0
