| `/tmp/.sysd` | PROPOSED | Alerted reverse shell binary target `` `/disk/tmp/.sysd` ``, `` `/sas/alerts.json` ``. |\n| 7 | Disable and quarantine systemd persistence service | `/etc/systemd/system/apache-cache.service` | PROPOSED | Alerted systemd service target `` `/disk/etc/systemd/system/apache-cache.service` ``, `` `/sas/alerts.json` ``. |\n| 8 | Quarantine residual binary / wiped cache file | `/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` | PROPOSED | Residual C2 artifact target `` `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` ``. |\n\n---\n\n## Prioritized Execution Sequence\n\n### Phase 1: Immediate Containment\n1. **Network Isolation / IP Blocking**: Apply firewall block for IP `198.51.100.136` `` `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:363` ``.\n2. **Kill Active Malicious Processes**: Terminate running instances of reverse shell process associated with `/tmp/.sysd` `` `/disk/tmp/.sysd` ``.\n3. **Disable Systemd Persistence**: Stop and disable `apache-cache.service` `` `/disk/etc/systemd/system/apache-cache.service` ``.\n\n### Phase 2: Quarantine & Eradication\n1. **Quarantine Web Shells**: Move `/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/status.jsp` `` `/disk/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/status.jsp` `` and `/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/.helper.jsp` `` `/disk/var/lib/tomcat9/webapps/ROOT/static/.helper.jsp` `` to secure quarantine storage `/var/backups/quarantine/`.\n2. **Quarantine Cron Persistence**: Remove `/etc/cron.d/apache-cache` `` `/disk/etc/cron.d/apache-cache` `` to backup quarantine.\n3. **Quarantine Systemd & Binary Artifacts**: Move `/etc/systemd/system/apache-cache.service` `` `/disk/etc/systemd/system/apache-cache.service` ``, `/tmp/.sysd` `` `/disk/tmp/.sysd` ``, and `/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` `` `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` `` to quarantine storage.\n\n### Phase 3: Vulnerability Remediation & Hardening\n1. Update Log4j dependency to version 2.17.1+ and update `/opt/app/log4j2.xml` `` `/disk/opt/app/log4j2.xml` ``.\n2. Re-configure SSH server (`/etc/ssh/sshd_conf