` `/disk/opt/jenkins/.xmr/xmrig:1` `` |\n| 7 | Quarantine RCE artifact | `/var/lib/jenkins/jobs/.tmp/config.xml` | OPEN | ADDED: Jenkins CLI RCE deserialization artifact | `` `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/jobs/.tmp/config.xml:1` `` |\n| 8 | Enable Jenkins Security Realm | `/var/lib/jenkins/config.xml` | OPEN | ADDED: Fix baseline security vulnerability (`useSecurity=false`) | `` `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/config.xml:3` `` |\n| 9 | Rotate SSH keys and credentials | Root and user credentials | OPEN | ADDED: Root password compromised via SSH brute force | `` `/disk/var/log/auth.log.1.gz:89` `` |\n| 10| Restore Jenkins log integrity and setup log shipping | `/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` | OPEN | ADDED: Evidence of log wiping/truncation detected | `` `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` `` |\n\n---\n\n## Phase 1: Immediate Containment & Network Isolation (Priority 1 — Immediate)\n1. **Network Layer Isolation & Perimeter Block**:\n   - Apply host firewall (`ufw`) and perimeter firewall rules to block `198.51.100.98` inbound and outbound (`` `/disk/var/log/auth.log.1.gz:89` ``).\n   - Block outbound DNS/TCP to C2 domain `update-jenkins.example.cn` and mining pool `xmr.jenkins.evil:3333` (`` `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` ``, `` `/disk/opt/jenkins/.xmr/xmrig:4` ``).\n   - *Verification*: `iptables -L -n -v | grep 198.51.100.98`.\n\n2. **Terminate Active Malicious Processes**:\n   - Terminate active cryptominer process (pid 1337) and any active reverse shells spawned by Groovy or cron (`` `/disk/opt/jenkins/.xmr/xmrig:3` ``, `` `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/init.groovy.d/z-backdoor.groovy:3` ``).\n   - *Verification*: `ps aux | grep -iE 'xmrig|z-backdoor|198.51.100.98'`.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 2: Eradication & Artifact Quarantine (Priority 2 — Within 1 Hour)\n1. **Quarantine Cryptominer Binary & RCE Artifacts**:\n   - Move `/opt/jenkins/.xmr/xmrig` and `/var/lib/jenkins/jobs/.tmp/config.xml` to a secure read-only forensic quarantine archive `/var/backups/quarantine_20260819.tar.gz` before removal (`` `/disk/opt/jenkins/.xmr/xmrig:1` ``, `` `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/jobs/.tmp/config.xml:1` ``).\n   - *Verification*: `ls -la /opt/jenkins/.xmr/xmrig` returns file not found; archive exists in `/var/backups/`.\n\n2. **Remove Backdoor Persistence Vectors**:\n   - Quarantine and remove malicious cron job from `/var/spool/cron/crontabs/jenkins` (`` `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/jenkins:4` ``).\n   - Quarantine and remove malicious Groovy init hook `/var/lib/jenkins/init.groovy.d/z-backdoor.groovy` (`` `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/init.groovy.d/z-backdoor.groovy:3` ``). Note: Maintain legitimate script `/var/lib/jenkins/init.groovy.d/logging.groovy` (`` `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/init.groovy.d/logging.groovy:2` ``).\n   - Remove attacker public SSH key from `/var/lib/jenkins/.ssh/authorized_keys` (`` `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/.ssh/authorized_keys:2` ``).\n   - *Verification*: `crontab -u jenkins -l`, `ls /var/lib/jenkins/init.groovy.d/`, and `cat /var/lib/jenkins/.ssh/authorized_keys`.\n\n3. **Credential & SSH Key Rotation**:\n   - Change passwords for all administrative users (`root`, `devops`, `webadmin`, `svc-backup`, `postgres`) (`` `/disk/etc/passwd:1` ``, `` `/disk/var/log/auth.log.1.gz:89` ``).\n   - Invalidate and rotate all SSH keypairs across all accounts.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 3: Vulnerability Patching & System Hardening (Priority 3 — Within 4 Hours)\n1. **Patch Jenkins (CVE-2024-23897)**:\n   - Upgrade Jenkins package to version 2.442 or LTS 2.426.3 or higher (`` `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:17` ``).\n   - Verify CLI argument parser option `-Dhudson.cli.CLICommand.allowForcedFirstArgument=false` is enforced.\n   - *Verification*: `jenkins --version` or check Jenkins Web GUI admin dashboard.\n\n2. **Harden Jenkins Configuration**:\n   - Enable security realm in `/var/lib/jenkins/config.xml` by setting `<useSecurity>true</useSecurity>` and configuring RBAC (`` `/disk/var/lib/jenkins/config.xml:3` ``).\n   - Set permissions on `/var/lib/jenkins/init.groovy.d/` to `root:root 755` so service users cannot inject initialization hooks.\n\n3. **Harden Host SSH Configuration**:\n   - Update `/etc/ssh/sshd_config` to set `PermitRootLogin no` and `PasswordAuthentication no` (`` `/disk/var/log/auth.log:131` ``).\n   - Restart SSH daemon: `systemctl restart sshd`.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 4: Verification & Recovery (Priority 4 — Post-Implementation)\n1. **Integrity & File Verification**:\n   - Run AIDE / integrity check on `/var/lib/jenkins` and system binaries.\n2. **Centralized Logging Setup**:\n   - Configure `rsyslog` / Fluentbit to stream `/var/log/auth.log`, `/var/log/nginx/access.log`, and Jenkins system logs to central SIEM to prevent future log truncation tampering (`` `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` ``).\n3. **Monitoring & Alerting Validation**:\n   - Confirm EDR alerts monitor Groovy script creation in `/var/lib/jenkins/init.groovy.d/` and SSH `authorized_keys` modifications.\nEOF\n"] min_timeout_sec: 0.5 max_timeout_sec: 180.0
