txt:18`) maps entry to ATT&CK T1133 (exposed Docker API), not any Windows RDP vulnerability.\n\n## 3. Confidence Level & Summary\n- **Exploited CVEs:** None identified on host. Confidence: HIGH (`/sas/vulns.json:1`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:18`).\n- **Entry Cause:** Exposure of unauthenticated management endpoint (`/disk/etc/docker/daemon.json:116`).\nEOF\n"] min_timeout_sec: 0.5 max_timeout_sec: 180.0
