tion XML and remove `UpdateHelper` task that executes `svc.exe` every 5 minutes. | `/disk/Windows/System32/Tasks/UpdateHelper` |\n| **6** | Quarantine Registry Run Key | `/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE` | **TODO** | Delete Registry Run value `svc -> C:\\\\Users\\\\Public\\\\svc.exe` under `HKLM\\\\SOFTWARE\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows\\\\CurrentVersion\\\\Run`. (**Silent finding**) | `/disk/Windows/System32/config/SOFTWARE` |\n| **7** | Stop & Disable Malicious Service | `/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys` | **TODO** | Stop service `svc-helper`, set startup type to Disabled, and move driver `svc-helper.sys` (`8525c122105c20ecbf866f40d8d60ad1fbbe21fd07a6b77c79182631931ede86`) to quarantine. | `/disk/Windows/System32/svc-helper.sys` |\n| **8** | Restore Audit Policy & Centralized Logging | `/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/Security.evtx` | **TODO** | Security event log was wiped (`EventID 1102`). Re-enable security auditing and configure SIEM log forwarding. (**Silent finding**) | `/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/Security.evtx` |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Step-by-Step Execution & Verification Plan\n\n### Phase 1: Immediate Network Containment\n1. **Perimeter Firewall Rule**: Add inbound drop rule for `198.51.100.92` on perimeter firewall (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:5`).\n   - *Verification*: Attempt ICMP/TCP connections from test subnets to verify blocking.\n2. **Isolate Host / Restrict RDP**: Block TCP 3389 at host/subnet level or allow access only via secure VPN (`/disk/Windows/System32/config/RDP-Tcp.reg:4`).\n\n### Phase 2: Credential & Access Reset\n1. **Force Password Resets**: Reset passwords for all administrative and service accounts (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:11`).\n2. **Revoke Active Sessions**: Terminate all active RDP and PowerShell remoting sessions (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:13`).\n\n### Phase 3: Eradication & Quarantine (Prefer Quarantine Over Direct Deletion)\n1. **Quarantine Payload**:\n   - Command: Move `C:\\\\Users\\\\Public\\\\svc.exe` to `C:\\\\Quarantine\\\\svc.exe.b